# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED: the generated contract and golden vector files.
#
#   01-contract/contract.py
#   01-contract/contract_data.h
#   01-contract/contract_runtime.h
#   01-contract/golden_vectors.json
#   01-contract/golden_vectors.h
#
# They are committed precisely so that a drift shows up as a diff in a pull
# request. That is the entire mechanism. Gitignoring generated artifacts is
# the instinct to resist here -- if they are not in the repo, `--check` has
# nothing to compare against and the whole level-1 defence evaporates.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
